    "detailed_description": "SPRINT.FIRE is a free-to-play, fast-paced multiplayer arena shooter with a focus on advanced movement and marksmanship. Looking to join the worlds of classic arena shooters and modern &quot;movement&quot; shooters, SPRINT.FIRE delivers quick action and rewarding gameplay kill after kill.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25b6 Carve your own path</h2>Wallrun, double-jump, vault, slide, and dash around your enemies bullets. With the ability to chain together moves and build momentum as you do, there are virtually limitless ways to traverse the map and out-maneuver your opponent.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25b6 No Microtransactions</h2>In-game cosmetics are unlocked through challenges and multiplayer progression alone. DLC will be available at no cost.",
